      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It seems like the \"scientific validation\" the psychometricians talk about is actually pretty contested if you look at the sociological side. Does the data actually support the idea that these tests are \"culturally neutral,\" or is the scientific consensus moving more towards the view that they are inherently biased?",
